<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-07T23:49:16.028Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 23:49:16 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces continue a month-long siege of Taiz while Yemeni government troops have seized the strategic al-Jawf mountain range, intensifying front-line fighting. The Saudi-led coalition intercepted a Houthi cruise missile and a long-range anti-tank guided missile over Riyadh and downed a Houthi ballistic missile aimed at Medina. A Saudi strike near Sanaa killed 22 people, mostly women and children, and a Houthi-claimed airstrike near the capital killed 22 people. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/7/houthis-report-25-killed-in-yemen-strikes?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168730&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPck9CUTVBTUgyQVJnZUxobTVpZGxIdTBmaGNmOWpHVWt4NUF4SHYyTWlUS1g2QmZ5RUd0YmJHVVpPQUVqa1lzVlJ1SU9HUUpDdzh0SVNFRW9KanJEZDJycDA5cVhxV0NKWnA5TUEtS2tkcDF4MTNjTUstalQwLXg3TVJXb3d1VlpaTUN6N1BFWHFfUk1FNm42QWdBSndJNDdQQUdNNlZKUVlLTUN6RmQ0aXluNHNUQUxYTW9vV0ZfUEFHX2tjXzBwZkpZeXA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOdElJT2IxV2wwQlBQVG9NaEo3MlZDblRVLWliMjE1dDYxd1hSYU5DVXFZdVpfQXdJR2tzOGo4LXBxdExUOXlWZWUtUkFER25sbGNnbG84U01Cd2N1NnpkM3lUVVRtcmMzNnNnbVV4bWcyUUhsSTdhRTRMM25sTGQ1MThVZGx6QU04akMyZ0pUcHlsdXMtUVZ6MXRvQ09Ia2d6X2dYdHlVU0dFZ2hRa0piNzdn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQNEp6NVBtbHhsbUIxVVRFM25lbmxYLWN0MmlhV1BTYTRZMHhJM0ppSmJhaHJfM05rNWI2UnRQVGEzT0lubW5XemFpd3Jnc1NFeUVrVFNMWUJ6Xzd4dEp1U2ZZLXMzV0VpTDNoWF9FeGFIb1l5TTRmbHhhOGhXblhRcVpVOWJTdktfYVN5b2JURXJ6LWR3